      "frozenRule": "Agent Plugins is a preferred portable package only. Setup chooses a qualified client mechanism; adapters are mechanical and cannot own Legion semantics; Pi is Baseline until executable evidence exists."
    },
    {
      "id": "state-lifecycle",
      "inputs": [
        "migration/native-rust/m0/state-contract.json"
      ],
      "frozenRule": "Legion owns only its durable state root, with version metadata, exclusive migration/lease coordination, snapshot rollback, interrupted recovery, and verified purge."
